    {
      "content": "<p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">To stay in Bangalore is to have the big question hovering over many people's heads: Is South Bangalore or East Bangalore preferable? Each has its own nature, advantage, and way of life. The choice of the appropriate location depends on your issues like travel, price range, lifestyle, and family needs.</span></p><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><br></h3><h2><b>Key Takeaways<br><br></b></h2><ul><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">South Bangalore provides great connectivity, high-end neighborhoods, and a strong cultural heritage.</li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">East Bangalore is a growing IT area with low-cost housing and is close to the airport.</li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Prices of real estate differ, with South Bangalore tending to be more expensive but settled.</li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Both have decent schools, hospitals, and recreational areas, but differ in lifestyle atmosphere.</li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Your decision should be based on work location, family requirements, and individual choice.<br><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br></span></li></ul><p></p><h2 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Overview of South Bangalore and East Bangalore</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" geo_transformation\":{\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false,\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false}},\"name\":\"_tocrd6l5iuaoamk\",\"id\":\"toc_gv5gxhfcupis\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_gv5gxhfcupis\">&nbsp;<br></span></b></h2><h3 style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">South Bangalore: The Established Hub</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocgiurudse86ux\",\"id\":\"toc_45w5hsm3lvum\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_45w5hsm3lvum\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocgiurudse86ux\",\"id\":\"toc_45w5hsm3lvum\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_45w5hsm3lvum\">&nbsp;</span></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">South Bangalore is marked by its highly developed infrastructure and cosmopolitan lifestyle. It comprises modern neighborhoods like Jayanagar, Koramangala, BTM Layout, and Electronic City. They offer a blend of traditional South Indian culture and modern urban lifestyles. The residential area consists of tree-lined streets, parks, and diverse cultural life with theatres and art galleries.</span></p><h3 style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">East Bangalore: The Emerging IT Powerhouse</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc4ux3fitd4543\",\"id\":\"toc_suqi3e12xbyr\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_suqi3e12xbyr\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc4ux3fitd4543\",\"id\":\"toc_suqi3e12xbyr\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_suqi3e12xbyr\">&nbsp;</span></h3><p></p><p></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" geo_transformation\":{\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false,\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false}},\"name\":\"_tocrd6l5iuaoamk\",\"id\":\"toc_gv5gxhfcupis\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_gv5gxhfcupis\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" geo_transformation\":{\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false,\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false}},\"name\":\"_tocrd6l5iuaoamk\",\"id\":\"toc_gv5gxhfcupis\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_gv5gxhfcupis\"></span></p><ul></ul><p></p><p style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\">East Bangalore has developed rapidly due to its access to big IT parks like <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/why-whitefield-stands-out-as-a-premier-locality-in-bangalore\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Whitefield</a>, Marathahalli, and the Outer Ring Road (ORR) corridor. Sarjapur Road, Kundalahalli, and Brookefield are attracting young professionals and families looking for relatively affordable housing near offices. The area has a peaceful environment with lakes and parks, but it still hasn't developed in infrastructure terms.<br></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\"><b>Feature</b></font></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\"><b>South Bangalore</b></font></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\"><b>East Bangalore</b></font></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Key Neighborhoods</font></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Jayanagar, Koramangala, BTM Layout</font></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Whitefield, Sarjapur, Marathahalli</font></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Lifestyle</font></span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Cosmopolitan, cultural, upscale</font></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Developing, IT-centric, serene</font></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Real Estate</font></span></p></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"font-family: fkGroteskNeue, \" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 10.5pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Premium apartments &amp; villas</font></span></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Affordable apartments &amp; gated communities</font></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Green Spaces</font></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Parks &amp; gardens</font></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font color=\"#000000\">Lakes &amp; jogging trails</font></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
