      "content": "<h2><b>Connectivity and Accessibility<br><br></b></h2><p></p><h3><p>South B<span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">angalore Connectivity</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2s66h2dt4moj\",\"id\":\"toc_f8mf9liipmzs\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_f8mf9liipmzs\" style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2s66h2dt4moj\",\"id\":\"toc_f8mf9liipmzs\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_f8mf9liipmzs\" style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><br></p></h3><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\">South Bangalore shines with its excellent connectivity. Key roads like Hosur Road, Bannerghatta Road, and NICE Expressway connect residents to key commercial hubs like Koramangala and Electronic City. The area enjoys good connectivity through the metro, with corridors extending to cover major localities.</p><ul><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\">Smooth connectivity to downtown Bangalore and IT parks</li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\">Well-established public transport systems</li><li style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\">Less traffic congestion than East Bangalore in some pockets</li></ul><h3><p style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">East Bangalore Connectivity</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocx0w9ynpheqom\",\"id\":\"toc_dodgrhhj7o8v\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_dodgrhhj7o8v\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocx0w9ynpheqom\",\"id\":\"toc_dodgrhhj7o8v\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_dodgrhhj7o8v\">&nbsp;</span></p></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0in\" data-text-indent=\"0in\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/why-bangalore-east-is-the-hottest-real-estate-market-in-2025\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">East Bangalore</a> is aided by its proximity to Kempegowda International Airport and IT hubs such as Whitefield and Outer Ring Road. Routes such as Old Airport Road and Old Madras Road improve connectivity. Metro lines are also being extended here, enhancing connectivity even more.</span></p><ul><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Location near the airport and IT parks</span></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Increasing the metro route and the bus network</span><br></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Peak hour traffic can be heavy.<br></li></ul><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Real Estate Trends and Pricing</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc7a918flaqoau\",\"id\":\"toc_up2kpmz527y5\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_up2kpmz527y5\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc7a918flaqoau\",\"id\":\"toc_up2kpmz527y5\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_up2kpmz527y5\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><h3><p style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">South Bangalore Real Estate</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpa5b7v8q8kzw\",\"id\":\"toc_j264or992vyw\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_j264or992vyw\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpa5b7v8q8kzw\",\"id\":\"toc_j264or992vyw\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_j264or992vyw\">&nbsp;</span></p></h3><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">South Bangalore has high-end residential choices such as luxury apartments, villas, and gated communities. Demand is fueled by Electronic City and other corporate hubs. The prices are higher here due to the existing infrastructure and lifestyle facilities.</p><ul><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Most sought after for long-term investment and high-end living</li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Serves ready-to-move and under-construction opportunities</li></ul><p></p><h3><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br>East Bangalore Real Estate<span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocfly5cc0238ru\",\"id\":\"toc_ulr0lwavi666\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ulr0lwavi666\" style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocfly5cc0238ru\",\"id\":\"toc_ulr0lwavi666\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ulr0lwavi666\" style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span></p></h3><p></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0in\" data-text-indent=\"0in\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">East Bangalore has lower-priced housing and is thus appealing to young professionals and families. It is also rapidly developing with several new apartment complexes and gated communities. Example -Its closeness to IT parks has created a real estate boom, and<a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/flats-for-rent-in-whitefield\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"> apartments for rent in Whitefield</span> </a>are much in demand.</span></p><ul><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Suitable for cost-conscious customers and IT staff.<br></span></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Increasing commercial and residential infrastructure.<br><br></li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Average rent&nbsp;</b></span></p></td><td><p><b>South Bangalore</b></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>East Bangalore</b></span></p></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">1 BHK For rent</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹20,000 - ₹30,000 per month</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹15,000 - ₹30,000 </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> per month</span></p></td><td><p><br></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">2 BHK For rent</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹35,000-₹60,000 per month</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹30,000 - ₹45,000 per month</span></p></td><td><p><br></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">3 BHK For rent</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹</span>50,000-1.75lacs <span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">per month</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹50,000-₹80,000 per month</span></p></td><td><p><br></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Property Types</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Villas, luxury apartments</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000990003\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Apartments, gated communities</span></p></td><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Educational and Healthcare Facilities</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc6mpjba8ijfed\",\"id\":\"toc_kmon4si054t5\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_kmon4si054t5\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc6mpjba8ijfed\",\"id\":\"toc_kmon4si054t5\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_kmon4si054t5\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><h3><p style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Education in South Bangalore</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc3c0hctdzng23\",\"id\":\"toc_c5a61ng3c5zb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_c5a61ng3c5zb\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc3c0hctdzng23\",\"id\":\"toc_c5a61ng3c5zb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_c5a61ng3c5zb\">&nbsp;</span></p></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">South Bangalore is home to some of the city's best educational institutions. National Public School (Jayanagar) and ORCHIDS The International School are a few schools that offer quality education. Christ University and JSS Academy are colleges that have students from all over India.</span></p><h3><p style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Education in East Bangalore</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocx6zv7w3ygxid\",\"id\":\"toc_ww77lr7rmz25\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ww77lr7rmz25\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocx6zv7w3ygxid\",\"id\":\"toc_ww77lr7rmz25\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ww77lr7rmz25\">&nbsp;</span></p></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">East Bangalore also boasts an increasing number of schools and colleges, specifically serving the families of IT professionals. Places such as Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences and International Tech Park schools are favorites.</span></p><h3><p style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Healthcare Facilities</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocxqmyq7v4bzkk\",\"id\":\"toc_16jxbtp7z57e\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_16jxbtp7z57e\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocxqmyq7v4bzkk\",\"id\":\"toc_16jxbtp7z57e\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_16jxbtp7z57e\">&nbsp;</span></p></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Both South and East Bangalore are well connected to world-class hospitals. South Bangalore boasts Manipal Hospitals, Kauvery Hospital, and Narayana Institute of Cardiac Sciences. East Bangalore boasts healthcare centers such as Vydehi Hospital and Columbia Asia Hospital.<br><br></span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Lifestyle and Culture</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc862d7zegney7\",\"id\":\"toc_efhidghvktcy\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_efhidghvktcy\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc862d7zegney7\",\"id\":\"toc_efhidghvktcy\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_efhidghvktcy\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><h3 style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">South Bangalore Lifestyle</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocx1nfk52838iv\",\"id\":\"toc_6ssp00cqou4m\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_6ssp00cqou4m\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocx1nfk52838iv\",\"id\":\"toc_6ssp00cqou4m\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_6ssp00cqou4m\">&nbsp;</span></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">South Bangalore provides a cosmopolitan and vibrant lifestyle. It maintains traditional South Indian culture with modern urban living. The residents have access to high-end malls, trendy cafes, parks, and cultural centers. The locality is famous for its greenery, cleanliness, and community activities.</span></p><h3 style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">East Bangalore Lifestyle</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc9l7rjihxylic\",\"id\":\"toc_ahtpqxbgjgoi\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ahtpqxbgjgoi\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc9l7rjihxylic\",\"id\":\"toc_ahtpqxbgjgoi\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ahtpqxbgjgoi\">&nbsp;</span></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">East Bangalore is more laid-back and in the process of development. It is best for those who enjoy quieter environments with access to nature. The fact that there are lakes and parks there promotes outdoor activities such as jogging and hiking. The social scene is comprised of IT professionals and local community events.</span></span></p>",
