    {
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Conclusion</b></span></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{}\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{}\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">South and East Bangalore have seen rapid real estate growth, both with their own strengths.</span></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{}\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{}\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span>South Bangalore is most appropriate for residential investment with excellent infrastructure, connectivity, and proximity to job hubs like Electronic City. It's renowned for upscale neighborhoods, quality education, world-class health care, and high living standards.</p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{}\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{}\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span>East Bangalore, with its locations like Panathur, Marathahalli, and Sarjapur Road, is a business hub due to its proximity to IT parks. It's preferred by professionals due to its cosmopolitan environment and proximity to multinational offices.</p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{}\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{}\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span>The choice between the two depends on personal priorities—nearness to workplace, lifestyle, price, travel time, and nearness to schools, hospitals, and recreational centers.</p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"7.5pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"></p><h2><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><br>FAQS</b></span></h2><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Q. Is South Bangalore a good place to live?<span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></b></p><p></p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"7.5pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Yes. South Bangalore is a nice place to reside. South Bangalore is a well-developed area with good schools, transportation, and infrastructure. It also has new housing schemes, green areas, and a rich history and culture</span></p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"7.5pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"></p><p><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;<br></span><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Q. Why is South Bangalore famous?</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc3h5j6xplqiq6\",\"id\":\"toc_qbnt98e3tu5e\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_qbnt98e3tu5e\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc3h5j6xplqiq6\",\"id\":\"toc_qbnt98e3tu5e\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_qbnt98e3tu5e\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p></p><p data-textformat=\"{\" type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">South Bangalore is renowned because it has a rich cultural history. There are many ancient temples and monuments, such as the popular Bull Temple and the ISKCON Temple, which are located here.</span></p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"7.5pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><br class=\"zw-br\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;</span>Q. Which part of Bangalore is more developed?</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc6mzsh30rl4x3\",\"id\":\"toc_9s0w3vl2hch9\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_9s0w3vl2hch9\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc6mzsh30rl4x3\",\"id\":\"toc_9s0w3vl2hch9\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_9s0w3vl2hch9\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">More developed parts of Bangalore are Marathahalli, Banashankari, Panathur, Koramangala, Jayanagar, JP Nagar, HSR Layout, Hosur Road, and many more. Residential buildings have experienced a significant surge in these localities.</span></p>",
